OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of flights into and out of the
OL,8,FUK have been cancelled following a
OL,9,Ftechnical problem affecting the air
OL,10,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,12,FAt least 625 flights in or out of the
OL,13,Fcountry have been cancelled, according
OL,14,Fto tracking website FlightRadar24.
OL,15,FEasyJet has made 200 cancellations and
OL,16,FBritish Airways has made more than 100.
OL,18,FNats said on Tuesday evening that its
OL,19,Fflight systems were starting to
OL,20,Frecover.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
