OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith few aircraft able to take off, it
OL,8,Fis understood landings are being
OL,9,Frestricted, leading to some flights
OL,10,Fbeing prevented from departing from
OL,11,Foverseas airports.
